!!id:"https://tson.io/test-suite/class2/schema/invalid/a-profile-may-not-add-an-invisible-character-expected.tn"
!!schema:"https://tson.io/test-suite/schemas/schema-sidecar.tn"
{
  spec: "[TSON-DATA] §8.2"
  description: """
    A profile's additions are its own, so the restricted-character rule does not
    judge them, and a floor holds what an addition may be: a character that
    renders as nothing (Default_Ignorable_Code_Point, so every Bidi_Control), a
    control, or a space other than U+0020. A soft hyphen added to Continue would
    make a name with one in it read as the name without it.
    """
  meta: "meta.tn"
  import: ["core.tn"]
  error: {
    category: resolver
  }
}
